  corr(P,-E) is the cleanest single number: positive means low-energy
  vertices are more likely, which is what an energy oracle must do. With
  drift=0 that correlation can ONLY come from the imprint, so a jump from
  ~0 at W-dag False to something positive at True is the whole result.
